      "cooked": "<p>Brief episode as the passing of Darren Watts made it difficult to do the expected episode.  Take care all</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/well-be-back-soon\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/well-be-back-soon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/well-be-back-soon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: We'll be back soon.</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Hey, folks. No real episode today, after all. Sorry for the break in schedule, but we didn't have it in us to make an RPG one-shot. I wrote a bit about it in . Thank you all for your patience. We'll be back on schedule next week. Speaking of which: ...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
